X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  As part of the <a href="https://go.iu.edu/Amer
 ica250" target="_blank" rel="noopener">America 250</a> initiative\, the L
 illy Library is proud to present an exhibition exploring the Declaration 
 of Independence.\n</p>
