X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/261/width/168/heig
 ht/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,600\,600/31041_pollinator_week_lw_square.r
 ev.1777391200.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  <strong>Lilly Library</strong><br />\n  <
 a href="mailto:liblilly@iu.edu">liblilly@iu.edu<br />\n  <br /></a>\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Join us at the Lilly Library on Thursday\, Jun
 e 18 from 2–4 p.m. for a family-friendly event to celebrate Pollinator 
 Week.\n</p>
